cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "SMM Panel Price Index"
abstract: >-
  Daily price index for SMM panels, the wholesale resellers behind social-media
  engagement services. Per canonical service: min, quartiles, median, max and a
  quotable range of prices per 1,000 units across 140+ panels, from 2026-09-07,
  plus per-panel domain and activity facts.
